# The repository stores LF. Pin the working tree to LF too, so a checkout made
# on Windows cannot reintroduce CRLF. Shell scripts are the reason this matters:
# a CRLF shebang makes the kernel look for an interpreter named "bash\r", and
# both WSL and MSYS2 then fail with an error that names neither the file nor the
# cause. Binary files are excluded automatically by content detection, and the
# more specific rules below still override this one.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.c.inc         diff=c
*.h.inc         diff=c
*.m             diff=objc
*.py            diff=python
*.rs            diff=rust
*.rs.inc        diff=rust
Cargo.lock      diff=toml merge=binary

*.patch         -text -whitespace
